# Greasewrench Goblin (2/1, "Exhaust - {2}{R}: Discard up to two cards, then draw that many cards. Put a +1/+1 counter on this
# creature"): Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and pays the exhaust cost, Ruby and two Moxen (the pool empty after). Discarding nothing draws nothing: only the counter.
# The counter comes either way (3/2), and on turn 3 the exhaust ability is not offered again with every source untapped.

